---
title: Privacy Policy
description: Learn how SEDS Sri Lanka respects and protects your personal information and student privacy.
---

SEDS Sri Lanka ("we", "our", or "the Organization") is dedicated to providing an inclusive, collaborative, and safe environment for all students and space enthusiasts. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, handle, and protect your information when you interact with our website, join our student community, or register for club events and workshops.

### 1. Information We Collect

When you engage with SEDS Sri Lanka, we may collect minimal personal details necessary for student community participation, including:

- **Contact Information**: Your name, email address, phone number, university or school affiliation, and academic field when you sign up via our Join Us forms or event registrations.
- **Order & Merchandise Inquiries**: Name, delivery address, phone number, and receipt details when purchasing official club merchandise.
- **Event Registrations**: Information provided during hackathons, workshops, stargazing sessions, and webinars.
- **Usage Data**: Non-identifiable technical data such as browser type, device information, and pages visited to help us optimize the website experience.

### 2. How We Use Your Information

We use the collected information exclusively for student club operations and community initiatives:

- To process student community memberships and connect you with university chapters and specialized technical divisions.
- To communicate upcoming workshops, rocket launches, observation nights, competitions, and community announcements.
- To coordinate merchandise order fulfillment and courier deliveries.
- To improve our online learning materials, projects, and website features.

We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data to third parties or commercial advertisers under any circumstances.

### 3. Data Storage & Security

We maintain reasonable security practices to protect your information against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. Our membership and registration forms utilize secure third-party platforms with encrypted data transmission.

### 4. Third-Party Services & Links

Our website may include links to external resources, university portals, social media profiles, and community tools (such as Discord, GitHub, Google Forms, and Tally). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of external third-party websites.

### 5. Media & Event Photography

During in-person campus events, workshops, and observation nights, photographs or video recordings of attendees may be taken for educational recaps and social media highlights. If you prefer not to appear in published club media, simply notify our event coordinators or media team at any time.

### 6. Your Rights & Inquiries

You may request updates, corrections, or the complete deletion of your membership information at any time.

If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, please reach out to our team:

- **Email**: [contact@sedssl.org](mailto:contact@sedssl.org)
- **Website**: [sedssl.org](https://sedssl.org)
